OL,3,GNEWSACrane to lift collapsed bridge out
OL,4,Aof harbour
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to repair a bridge which collapsed
OL,7,Finto a city's harbour is set to begin.
OL,9,FPero's Bridge in Bristol, which could
OL,10,Flift to allow boats under it, was left
OL,11,Fpartially hanging due to a mechanical
OL,12,Ffailure in the summer. It then toppled
OL,13,Fagain, collapsing into the water on 31
OL,14,FOctober.
OL,16,FEarlier this month, a Bristol City
OL,17,FCouncil report found the bridge was
OL,18,Funable to be properly tested for almost
OL,19,Fa decade before its collapse due to the
OL,20,Fweight of padlocks attached to it.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
